# Experiment images moved to ../experiment_images_20260909 (too large for GitHub).
# Only text records (json/txt/log/md/csv/yaml) under experiments/ are tracked.
experiments/**
!experiments/**/
!experiments/**/*.json
!experiments/**/*.txt
!experiments/**/*.log
!experiments/**/*.md
!experiments/**/*.csv
!experiments/**/*.yaml
!experiments/**/*.yml

# --- v19 GitHub-sync additions (2026-09-18, "nothing missing" package) ---
# 1. Training logs ARE project records: un-ignore them (the global `*.log`
#    boilerplate rule above silently excluded train_logs/*.log — the primary
#    quantitative evidence of every wave).
!train_logs/*.log
# 2. git bundles (export artifacts) never belong in the repo itself.
*.bundle
# 3. User-calibration images are local-only (158MB), but its MANIFEST (the
#    full 172-panel metric table = §7.9/7.10 evidence) is project record.
#    NOTE: `dir/**` (not `dir/`) so the negation below can re-include.
user_calibration_*/**
!user_calibration_20260918/MANIFEST.md

# --- local-machine additions (2026-09-18 sync from full bundle) ---
BUNDLE_INFO_*.txt
new/
